<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>लोधा समाज इंदौर — YouTube kit</title>
  <!--
    The five pictures a YouTube channel asks for, each drawn at the exact size
    YouTube wants. tools/make_youtube_kit.py screenshots them one element at a
    time, so what lands on disk is already the right shape - no resizing
    afterwards, which is where text goes soft.

    The banner's one real constraint is the safe area. YouTube shows the whole
    2560x1440 only on a television; on a phone it shows a 1546x423 strip from
    the middle and throws the rest away. So everything that must be read lives
    inside .safe, and the area outside it carries colour and nothing else.

    Like the reel's end card and the share card, this is a template and NOT a
    page of the site: it is copied to a dot-path at the root for the shots and
    removed. See the note in tools/reel-intro-endcard.html.in.
  -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/site.css">
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; background: #555; font-family: var(--body); }
    .shot { position: relative; overflow: hidden; margin: 0; }

    /* ---- channel banner: 2560x1440, read on a phone as the middle 1546x423 ---- */
    #banner { width: 2560px; height: 1440px;
      background:
        radial-gradient(90% 60% at 50% 50%, rgba(232, 163, 61, 0.26), transparent 70%),
        var(--ind-d);
      display: grid; place-items: center; }
    #banner .safe {
      width: 1546px; height: 423px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 46px;
      color: #fff; text-align: left;
    }
    #banner .safe img { width: 210px; height: auto; }
    #banner h1 { margin: 0; font-family: var(--head); font-weight: 400;
                 font-size: 112px; line-height: 1.1; color: #fff; }
    #banner .tag { margin: 10px 0 0; color: var(--mar); font-size: 38px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; }
    #banner .url { margin: 18px 0 0; font-size: 46px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; }

    /* ---- profile picture: 800x800, but it is read at about 48px ---- */
    /* The logo and nothing else. A name line under it was tried and cut: at
       48px it is a grey smudge, and the logo already carries the words
       "लोधा समाज इंदौर" inside it. YouTube crops this to a circle, so the logo
       is sized against the inscribed circle, not the square. */
    #avatar { width: 800px; height: 800px;
      background: radial-gradient(85% 70% at 50% 40%, #4a3c7a, var(--ind-d));
      display: grid; place-items: center; }
    #avatar img { width: 560px; height: auto; }

    /* ---- video thumbnails: 1280x720 ---- */
    .thumb { width: 1280px; height: 720px; position: relative; color: #fff; }
    .thumb .plate { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: grid; place-items: center;
                    padding: 0 90px; text-align: center; }
    .thumb h2 { margin: 0; font-family: var(--head); font-weight: 400;
                font-size: 96px; line-height: 1.18; }
    .thumb .kicker { margin: 0 0 18px; color: var(--mar); font-size: 38px;
                     letter-spacing: 0.08em; }
    .thumb .url { margin: 26px 0 0; font-size: 44px; font-weight: 700; }

    #thumb-parichay {
      background:
        radial-gradient(95% 70% at 50% 0%, rgba(232, 163, 61, 0.26), transparent 66%),
        var(--ind-d);
    }
    #thumb-parichay img.logo { width: 132px; margin-bottom: 20px; }

    /* The गरबा thumbnail stands on a real frame of the reel, darkened enough
       for white text to clear the contrast threshold over the brightest part
       of it. */
    #thumb-garba { background: #000; }
    #thumb-garba .bg { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
                       object-fit: cover; }
    #thumb-garba .veil { position: absolute; inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(20,16,34,0.55), rgba(20,16,34,0.78)); }

    /* ---- watermark: 150x150, sits over the corner of every video ---- */
    #watermark { width: 150px; height: 150px; display: grid; place-items: center;
                 background: transparent; }
    #watermark img { width: 150px; height: auto; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <figure class="shot" id="banner">
    <div class="safe">
      <img src="/assets/img/logo.png" alt="">
      <div>
        <h1>लोधा समाज इंदौर</h1>
        <p class="tag">सेवा · शिक्षा · स्वास्थ्य</p>
        <p class="url">lodhasamaj.org</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </figure>

  <figure class="shot" id="avatar"><img src="/assets/img/logo.png" alt=""></figure>

  <figure class="shot thumb" id="thumb-parichay">
    <div class="plate">
      <div>
        <img class="logo" src="/assets/img/logo.png" alt="">
        <p class="kicker">लोधा समाज इंदौर</p>
        <h2>वेबसाइट अब तैयार है</h2>
        <p class="url">lodhasamaj.org</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </figure>

  <figure class="shot thumb" id="thumb-garba">
    <img class="bg" src="/assets/video/2026/garba-reel.jpg" alt="">
    <div class="veil"></div>
    <div class="plate">
      <div>
        <p class="kicker">लोधा समाज इंदौर</p>
        <h2>नवदुर्गा महोत्सव 2026<br>गरबा</h2>
        <p class="url">lodhasamaj.org</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </figure>

  <figure class="shot" id="watermark"><img src="/assets/img/logo.png" alt=""></figure>
</body>
</html>
